  "description": "Hookwood is one of the few wild plants on Arrakis that yields usable wood. Its dry, fibrous timber can be hauled and used wherever a bill or construction choice accepts wood.\n\nThe harvest is limited. Use stone, metal or local cloth where a building permits an alternative, and reserve timber for work that needs it. Finding hookwood does not establish a forest or a guaranteed timber-import route.",
